10/18/2026  12:38 AM

INPUT INSTRUCTIONS

  TITLE: latents sampling weights in a three-profile VVI mixture;
  DATA: FILE = weights.dat;
  VARIABLE:
   NAMES = id y1 y2 y3 y4 w;
   USEVARIABLES = y1 y2 y3 y4;
   IDVARIABLE = id;
   WEIGHT = w;
   CLASSES = c(3);
  ANALYSIS:
   TYPE = MIXTURE;
   STARTS = 400 80;
   STSEED = 20261018;
   MITERATIONS = 10000;
   LOGCRITERION = 0.00000001;
   RLOGCRITERION = 0.000000001;
   MCONVERGENCE = 0.000001;
  MODEL:
   %OVERALL%
   %c#1%
   [y1-y4]; y1-y4;
   %c#2%
   [y1-y4]; y1-y4;
   %c#3%
   [y1-y4]; y1-y4;
  SAVEDATA:
   FILE = weights-posteriors.dat;
   SAVE = CPROBABILITIES;
   FORMAT = F20.12;
   RESULTS = weights-results.dat;



*** WARNING in MODEL command
  All variables are uncorrelated with all other variables within class.
  Check that this is what is intended.
   1 WARNING(S) FOUND IN THE INPUT INSTRUCTIONS



latents sampling weights in a three-profile VVI mixture;

